'REJECT
' A mock declared for more arguments than the function takes matches nothing, and would read
' at run time as a mock that simply never fired.
' SUBJECT: approve-order.bu
' ERROR: LOAD_ORDER takes 1 argument(s) but was given 2
PROGRAM WrongArity
    "LOAD_ORDER" WITH ARGS(1, 2) RETURNS "o1"
    RUN
    RESULT IS TRUE
END.
